{"id":"07c01766ddf08181","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic.md","title":"Rice Theorem (Arithmetic Version)","display":"thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic — Rice Theorem (Arithmetic Version)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic","aliases":["92-thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic"],"display":"thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic — Rice Theorem (Arithmetic Version)","depends_on":["[[92-df-ce-set]]","[[92-df-decidable-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic — Rice Theorem (Arithmetic Version)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((W_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (standard effective enumeration of the CE subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> (extensional property of CE sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(I_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (index set for the property)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}\\)</span> (decidable-set predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\nI_{\\mathcal P}\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N\\mid W_e\\in\\mathcal P\\},\n\\qquad\n\\Bigl(\\exists e\\;W_e\\in\\mathcal P\\Bigr)\n\\land\\Bigl(\\exists e\\;W_e\\notin\\mathcal P\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(I_{\\mathcal P})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\nI_{\\mathcal P}\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N\\mid W_e\\in\\mathcal P\\},\n\\qquad\n\\Bigl(\\exists e\\;W_e\\in\\mathcal P\\Bigr)\n\\land\\Bigl(\\exists e\\;W_e\\notin\\mathcal P\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(I_{\\mathcal P})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rice定理判定的是程序/枚举器的索引集合，而不是把性质对象本身写成<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner P\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner P\\urcorner\\)</span></li>\n<li>非平凡：存在r.e.集满足性质，也存在r.e.集不满足</li>\n<li>例如“枚举集是否非空”“是否有限”等非平凡外延性质的索引集不可判定</li>\n<li>例：&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>是否有限&quot;不可判定</li>\n<li>Rice定理是停机问题的推广</li>\n<li>Rice定理与可证性不可判定可通过计算归约联系，但“句子是否可证”不是这里对单个c.e.集合的外延性质，因此不完备性不是本定理的字面特例</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(W_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice\\text{-}theorem\\text{-}arithmetic}\\vdash\nI_{\\mathcal P}\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N\\mid W_e\\in\\mathcal P\\},\n\\qquad\n\\Bigl(\\exists e\\;W_e\\in\\mathcal P\\Bigr)\n\\land\\Bigl(\\exists e\\;W_e\\notin\\mathcal P\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(I_{\\mathcal P})","display":true},{"tex":"\\ulcorner P\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1545,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-182","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-ce-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-ch-independence.md]]\n[[92-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[92-thm-completeness-fo.md]]\n[[92-thm-consistency-addable.md]]\n[[92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-thm-craig-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-deduction-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[92-thm-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-godel-incompleteness-general.md]]\n[[92-thm-godel-set-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-halting-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-incompleteness-recursive-extension.md]]\n[[92-thm-induction-axiom-decidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-k-g-equivalent.md]]\n[[92-thm-lob-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-m-complete-creative.md]]\n[[92-thm-numeral-injective.md]]\n[[92-thm-omega-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-pairing-bijective.md]]\n[[92-thm-pi1-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-pr-representable-detailed.md]]\n[[92-thm-pr-representable.md]]\n[[92-thm-reflection-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-reflection-unprovable.md]]\n[[92-thm-representability.md]]\n[[92-thm-representation-strong.md]]\n[[92-thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-thm-rosser-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-schema-axiom-decidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-second-incompl